 tool with ransomware as a business model.</p></div><div class=\"cms-card_button-wrapper\"><div data-w-id=\"7c0c7317-1185-f172-f55b-212e80f113ec\" class=\"button-secondary\"><div>Read the Blog</div><div class=\"button-secondary-icon-wrap\"><div data-w-id=\"7c0c7317-1185-f172-f55b-212e80f113ef\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\" class=\"button-secondary-icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M1.00066 6.00001H10.3563M10.3563 6.00001L5.67847 10.6778M10.3563 6.00001L5.67847 1.32221\" stroke=\"currentcolor\" stroke-width=\"1.34566\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></div><div data-w-id=\"7c0c7317-1185-f172-f55b-212e80f113f0\" style=\"transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\" class=\"button-secondary-icon is-absolute w-embed\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M1.00066 6.00001H10.3563M10.3563 6.00001L5.67847 10.6778M10.3563 6.00001L5.67847 1.32221\" stroke=\"currentcolor\" stroke-width=\"1.34566\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></div></div></div></div></a>","link":"https://www.halcyon.ai/blog/malware-vs-ransomware-a-primer","retrieved":1770249600000},{"title":"From Cybercrime to Conflict: Why Infrastructure Defenders Must Rethink Risk","contents":"<a id=\"w-node-b2fdc094-047f-c870-a23f-981d2fce238d-bedec3de\" data-w-id=\"b2fdc094-047f-c870-a23f-981d2fce238d\" data-wf-native-id-path=\"b2fdc094-047f-c870-a23f-981d2fce238d_instance-8\" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking=\"true\" data-wf-element-id=\"b2fdc094-047f-c870-a23f-981d2fce238d\" data-wf-cms-context=\"%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%226568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3c5%